    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Could you go a bit deeper into the enzymatic breakdown specifically? I want to make sure I explain how the cell structure disruption leads to that specific reaction between the alliinase and the sulfoxides. Also, why does it happen so suddenly? It feels like it hits you out of nowhere.",
